---
// BeP09 figure: BeP09E2ESteps
---
<figure class="bep9n5">
  <div class="bep9n5-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 245" role="img" aria-label="Five steps of the end-to-end test: start uvicorn as a subprocess on port 4339, wait until the port accepts connections, log in as bob through POST /token, read alice's case with that valid login and get a 404, then stop the server in a finally block even when a test fails.">
    <rect x="20" y="50" width="140" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <circle cx="42" cy="50" r="13" class="dot" />
    <text x="42" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="num">1</text>
    <text x="90" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>start uvicorn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khởi động uvicorn</tspan></text>
    <text x="90" y="108" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>subprocess, port 4339</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>subprocess, port 4339</tspan></text>
    <line x1="160" y1="90" x2="190" y2="90" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="200,90 190,85 190,95" class="hd" />
    <rect x="200" y="50" width="140" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <circle cx="222" cy="50" r="13" class="dot" />
    <text x="222" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="num">2</text>
    <text x="270" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>wait for the port</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đợi port mở</tspan></text>
    <text x="270" y="108" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>until it accepts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tới khi nhận kết nối</tspan></text>
    <line x1="340" y1="90" x2="370" y2="90" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="380,90 370,85 370,95" class="hd" />
    <rect x="380" y="50" width="140" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <circle cx="402" cy="50" r="13" class="dot" />
    <text x="402" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="num">3</text>
    <text x="450" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>POST /token</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>POST /token</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="108" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>bob logs in</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bob đăng nhập</tspan></text>
    <line x1="520" y1="90" x2="550" y2="90" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="560,90 550,85 550,95" class="hd" />
    <rect x="560" y="50" width="140" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <circle cx="582" cy="50" r="13" class="dot" />
    <text x="582" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="num">4</text>
    <text x="630" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>GET alice's case</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GET case của alice</tspan></text>
    <text x="630" y="108" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>a valid login</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>login hợp lệ</tspan></text>
    <line x1="700" y1="90" x2="730" y2="90" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="740,90 730,85 730,95" class="hd" />
    <rect x="740" y="50" width="140" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <circle cx="762" cy="50" r="13" class="dot" />
    <text x="762" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="num">5</text>
    <text x="810" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>stop the server</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tắt server</tspan></text>
    <text x="810" y="108" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>in finally, even on fail</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trong finally, kể cả khi fail</tspan></text>
    <line x1="630" y1="130" x2="630" y2="166" class="redln" />
    <polygon points="630,176 625,166 635,166" class="redhd" />
    <text x="630" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>404 for bob</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>404 cho bob</tspan></text>
    <text x="630" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>valid login, not his case</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>login hợp lệ, không phải case của anh ấy</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="28" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>scope="module": the server starts once for the file</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>scope="module": server khởi động một lần cho cả file</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The in-process tests never run this path: a real process, a real socket and a real login. Step 4 is the one worth having, because a valid login still has to get a 404.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Test in-process không bao giờ đi qua đường này: process thật, socket thật, login thật. Bước 4 là bước đáng có, vì login hợp lệ vẫn phải nhận 404.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep9n5 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep9n5-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep9n5 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep9n5 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep9n5 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n5 .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n5 .bs { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep9n5 .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep9n5 .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep9n5 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep9n5 .redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n5 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep9n5 .redln { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n5 .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep9n5 .redhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n5 .bar { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep9n5 .redbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n5 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .bep9n5 .dot { fill: var(--text); }
  .bep9n5 .num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--bg); }
</style>
